  "prefLabel": "Pda 601.06 Transient commercial fishing vessel",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 601.06 “Transient commercial fishing vessel” means a commercial fishing vessel without an annual pier use permit for a business-use pier that utilizes a business-use pier on a one-time basis for repairs, take-out, or other purpose consistent with rules under Pda 600 relating to the use of business-use piers.\n\nSource. #8321, eff 10-1-05; ss by #8759, eff 11-18-06; ss by #10441, eff 11-1-13 (from Pda 601.05); ss by #13806, eff 11-17-23",
